      "id": "l1",
      "text": "Doña Marta vende pan en el mercado.",
      "en": "Doña Marta sells bread at the market.",
      "picture": "👵🍞🛒",
      "audio": {
        "status": "needed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "text": "Ella vende pan para la clínica y para la escuela.",
      "en": "She sells bread for the clinic and for the school.",
      "picture": "🍞🏥🏫",
      "audio": {
        "status": "needed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "text": "Abuela, ¿te gusta vender pan?",
      "en": "Grandma, do you like selling bread?",
      "speaker": "nico",
      "picture": "❓",
      "audio": {
        "status": "needed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "text": "Sí, me gusta mucho. Y a vos, ¿qué te gusta comer?",
      "en": "Yes, I like it a lot. And you, what do you like to eat?",
      "speaker": "marta",
      "picture": "🙂",
      "audio": {
        "status": "needed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "text": "Me gusta comer arroz.",
      "en": "I like to eat rice.",
      "speaker": "nico",
      "picture": "🍚",
      "audio": {
        "status": "needed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "text": "El pan cuesta diez lempiras y el arroz veinte, pero para vos no cuesta nada.",
      "en": "The bread costs ten lempiras and the rice twenty, but for you it costs nothing.",
      "speaker": "marta",
      "picture": "🍞10 🍚20 😄",
      "audio": {
        "status": "needed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "text": "Luis es el maestro de Nico. Su hermana Ana trabaja en la clínica.",
      "en": "Luis is Nico's teacher. His sister Ana works at the clinic.",
      "picture": "👨‍🏫 👩‍⚕️🏥",
      "audio": {
        "status": "needed"
      }
    },
    {
